{"id":"payees-paid-after-registration-closed","title":"Payees paid after their only registration closed","question":"Which City payees were paid in fiscal years after every location of their only registry account had closed?","finding":"106 of the 3,148 payees matched to one account (3.4%) were paid $126.9 million in fiscal years after that account closed, with no open account under a like name or at the same address. 8 accounts were closed administratively by the Tax Collector. The largest is Harrison Assets LLC ($34.9 million after 2011-06-20). Many rows are abbreviations of a name the payee also registered in full; they are a place to look, not a finding.","how":"For each payee joined to one account, the latest end date across its locations is compared with the fiscal years of payment. A row is dropped when another open account carries a like name or sits at one of the closed account's addresses under a name with a shared word.","limits":"A business that moves, incorporates or is bought often opens a new account under a new name; the registry's abbreviations (\"Resrch\", \"Fndtn\") defeat a name test. Out-of-town suppliers selling by mail may owe no registration. Payment after closure is a question for the Tax Collector, not a sign that work was not done.","tier":"REDFLAG","columns":[{"k":"payee","t":"City payee","type":"org"},{"k":"paid","t":"Paid since fiscal 2019","type":"usd"},{"k":"dept","t":"Mostly from","type":"text"},{"k":"closed","t":"Registry account closed","type":"date"},{"k":"admin","t":"Closed by the Tax Collector","type":"text"},{"k":"paidAfter","t":"Paid in later fiscal years","type":"usd"},{"k":"lastPaid","t":"Last paid (fiscal year)","type":"year"},{"k":"basis","t":"How joined","type":"text"}],"rows":[{"payee":"Harrison Assets LLC","paid":34906904,"dept":"Human Services Agency","closed":"2011-06-20","admin":"no","paidAfter":34906904,"lastPaid":2027,"basis":"name match only"},{"payee":"Buckles-Smith Electric Co","paid":21146370,"dept":"Public Uti